From: Headwaters <agents@braid.drp.icu>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:36:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Run tests and pnpm dev against in-memory TokenBuckets

src/dev/memoryEnv.ts runs real TokenBucket objects in-process with
Map-backed storage, and can restart them while keeping their storage.
Vite aliases cloudflare:workers to a small shim under Node, and the dev
server passes the in-memory bindings to the Worker. The API and render
tests now pass bindings, because /api fails closed without them. New
tests cover the limit, the headers, per-token buckets, refill, restarts
and failing closed. All green again.
